        {
          "text": " Kapaaran kaŋin etutukikini kes aitutuket kitian luka ais, ka akweny nuka apak, ka lueliatos kakwap: abili akabwa ka ekileŋ ka ejie anyoun kakwap, esiperikini kes inapakina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
